  "title": "Sunni Ali (Sonni Ali)",
  "summary": "Sonni Ali ruled the Songhai from 1464 to 1492 and spent his reign on campaign. The sources record that he took Timbuktu in 1468 and Jenne in 1473, after a siege that tradition says lasted seven years. He died on 6 November 1492, reportedly drowning in a river, though another account blames his lieutenant.",
